cosmic-epoch-monorepo (1.5.0-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * New upstream release: Cosmic Epoch 1.5.0.
    - Translation and dependency updates for many projects
    - cosmic-bg:
      - Use EXIF orientation
    - cosmic-comp:
      - Fix SIGABRT when kiosk child exits, and ignore EPERM/EACCES error on DRM cleanup
      - Workaround for Chromium apps breaking below 1.0 scaling
      - Fix dbus deadlock in a11y keyboard monitor
      - Ensure X window focus on unmap/map
      - Don't panic when renderer creation fails after a GPU reset
      - Clamp pointer edge after applying the output offset
      - Check LayerHookId for layer surfaces in corner_radius
    - cosmic-greeter:
      - Use cosmic-keymap-unstable-v1 wayland protocol
    - cosmic-initial-setup:
      - Fix list alignment
    - cosmic-panel:
      - Fix frosted glass for applets on hotplugged external monitor
      - Fix flickering when using frosted glass when preserving style on window maximize
      - Close popups on all outputs before adding a new one
      - Fixes for touch input
      - Fix high CPU usage when screen is locked
    - cosmic-settings:
      - Increase wallpaper limit from 100 to 500
      - Use EXIF orientation for wallpaper
      - Allow adding multiple wallpaper images at once
      - Slider widget handle improvements
      - Fix 1-pixel gap between display outputs due to rounding error
      - Networking: stop storing VPN username as a secret
    - cosmic-settings-daemon:
      - Brightness: drop cached DDC handles when idle to fix hangs
    - cosmic-store:
      - Center text in places where container content is aligned to center
    - cosmic-term:
      - Configurable terminal pane borders
    - xdg-desktop-portal-cosmic:
      - Screencast: support metadata cursor capture

 -- Ritesh Raj Sarraf <rrs@debian.org>  Thu, 30 Jul 2026 10:00:00 +0000

cosmic-epoch-monorepo (1.4.0-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * New upstream release: Cosmic Epoch 1.4.0.
    - Add cosmic-sound-theme for packaging (replaces pop-os/gtk-theme)
    - Translation and dependency updates for many projects
    - cosmic-applets:
      - NetworkManager secret agent re-registration on restart
    - cosmic-comp:
      - Remove attempts to force redraw
      - Fix frozen/detached active window hint
      - Fix input to cropped tiled windows
      - Notify readiness on non-systemd systems
      - Fix kiosk command with command line options
      - Migrate from unmaintained vector math library
      - Fix feature gate for logind
      - Fix flicker when switching menus in tiled apps
      - Fix fullscreen issues with some games
      - Improve edge pointer accuracy with fractional scaling
      - Release active popup grabs on toplevel destruction
      - Fix fractional scaling border width discrepancy
    - cosmic-files:
      - Fall back to GIO on MTP copy failures
      - Fix trash directory detection
    - cosmic-launcher:
      - Reset results on search query changes
    - cosmic-monitor:
      - Implement application quit and force quit
      - Graph type switching, design updates, and GPU freq collection
    - cosmic-panel:
      - Fix crash by setting minimum size for anchor rect
      - Fix crash when changing output scale
    - cosmic-settings:
      - Preserve content when rebuilding appearance drawer
      - Fix source volume changes applying to sink
    - cosmic-settings-daemon:
      - Add volume step configuration
    - cosmic-workspaces:
      - Clean up blur rectangles when toplevel is closed
    - xdg-desktop-portal-cosmic:
      - Run as system service, use tracing/journald
      - Terminate if Wayland thread crashes

 -- Ritesh Raj Sarraf <rrs@debian.org>  Thu, 23 Jul 2026 05:32:25 +0000

